{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48065","headline":"与谢翶赠荅诗 四 · 金车美人","name":"与谢翶赠荅诗 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惆怅佳期一梦中，武陵春色尽成空。\n欲知离别偏堪恨，只爲音尘两不通。\n愁态上眉凝浅绿，泪痕侵脸落轻红。\n双轮暂与王孙驻，明日西驰又向东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"金车美人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}